# Nimki Assembly Syntax
name: Assembly
extensions: .asm .s .inc
comment_single: ;
keywords: mov add sub mul div jmp je jne jg jl jge jle call ret push pop nop xor and or not inc dec cmp test lea syscall int loop enter leave
types: eax ebx ecx edx esp ebp esi edi rax rbx rcx rdx rsp rbp rsi rdi r8 r9 r10 r11 r12 r13 r14 r15 al ah bl bh cl ch dl dh byte word dword qword ptr section data text bss global extern
